  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following substances<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0082_54ce9f14913a.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:4.99167in;height:1.29167in\" /><br />\r<br />\rThe decreasing order of basicity is"
